From 00c774f933665f176abe6e243cf60a4f2a269b86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 05:28:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Bound dashboard warm refresh to changed history

Ready-floor, terminal-provider, latest-block and latest-kind reductions are
retained per immutable event history (type-exact run keys). Trusted P2 refreshes
detect only the unmarked heartbeat inserts with kind/task index seeks instead of
counting every displayed task's history; legacy refreshes keep whole-history
count/max, now derived from the events actually retained. Retained runs compare
ids and bookkeeping through a quoted SQL signature and merge type-exact updates.

Task t_01a1d59e5543daa1 (card E).
